==English==

===Etymology===
Named after the Indian cricketer {{w|Vinoo Mankad}}.
hi

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{lb|en|cricket}} A [[run out]] of the [[non-striker]] by the [[bowler]] before [[bowling]] the ball if the non-striker leaves his [[crease]] too early; thought by some to be [[ungentlemanly]], but is within the rules of the game hi.

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{lb|en|cricket}} To run a player out by this means.

